            "runtimes": [
              {
                "asset": {
                  "content": "# Custom runtime\n\nThe custom runtime constructs `order-triage` through `createOrderTriageAgent`. It supplies the factory with an asynchronous canonical-instruction loader; the factory passes `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md` to that loader and uses the returned content as the agent instruction.\n\nThe loader's storage and deployment mechanism is runtime-owned and is not implemented in this repository. The factory otherwise exposes only the `order-triage` identity, the `classify-for-human-review` action, and the explicit inability to approve refunds.\n",
